  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Elite Hex Spell. Target foe takes 10...50...60 cold damage. If you have more Energy than target foe, that foe suffers an additional 10...50...60 cold damage and moves 90% slower for 1...4...5 second[s].",
      "zhTW": "使目標敵人受到 10～60 冰凍傷害。若你比敵人擁有更多能量，則敵人將額外受到 10～60 冰凍傷害，而且使其移動速度減慢 90% 並持續 1～5 秒。此魔法會造成施法者精疲力竭。"
    },
    "pvp": {
